<title>USA: Audiovox Q1 Feb 28 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Audiovox Q1 Feb 28 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAGE, N.Y. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.24		    $0.05</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.23		     0.05</p>
<p> Net			  4,203			479</p>
<p> Revs		     166,614		  122,493</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	17,726		    9,285</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	18,531		    9,326</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is Audiovox Corp.</p>
<p>Excluding $14.7 million net gain on the sale of CellStar shares and costs from exchanging $21.5 million of subordinated debentures into common shares, pro form Q1 net income was $0.14 per share primary and $0.13 per share fully diluted.</p>
</text>
